==== owsync-advanced
h2: High Availability - Advanced Config Sync
Custom sync groups for services beyond General settings (e.g., VPN, mwan3).
h3: Global Settings
owsync global options.
advanced.sync_interval [CBI.Value] Poll Interval (seconds): value=45 (placeholder "30")
  help: Seconds between scans of the synced files. A local change is sent to the peers after the next scan.
advanced.owsync_log_level [CBI.ListValue] Log Level: select=1 {0,1,2,3}
  help: Verbosity of owsync daemon logging.
h3: Additional Sync Groups
Click Edit to configure files.
| Name | Status | Files | 
| openvpn: openvpn | Enabled | 2 configured | [☰][Edit][Delete]
| mwan3: mwan3 | Disabled | 1 configured | [☰][Edit][Delete]
| ipsec: ipsec | Enabled (not set) | 1 configured | [☰][Edit][Delete]
<input> 
<button> Add
h3: Exclusions
Files never synced; exclusions take precedence over sync groups. Default: network, system, owsync, ha-cluster, wireless.
<anon>.file [CBI.ChipListValue] Excluded Files: chip=network chip=system chip=owsync chip=ha-cluster chip=wireless value= (placeholder "/etc/dropbear/*.key") button "Add"
==== owsync-advanced modal openvpn
h4: High Availability - Advanced Config Sync - openvpn
openvpn.enabled [CBI.FlagValue] Enable Sync: [x]
  help: Enable synchronization for this group.
openvpn.config_files [CBI.DynamicList] Files/Directories to Sync: item=openvpn item=/etc/openvpn/keys
  help: UCI names (e.g., "openvpn") or absolute paths (e.g., "/etc/openvpn/keys").
<button> Dismiss
<button> Save
